<title>USA: South St Paul, Minn., $2 mln won by Juran &amp; Moody.</title>
<headline>South St Paul, Minn., $2 mln won by Juran &amp; Moody.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juran &amp; Moody, Inc said it won $2.010 million of South St Paul, Minn., general obligation arena revenue bonds, Series 1997A, wit h a true interest cost of 5.44 percent.</p>
</text>
